,{"class":278},"https:\u002F\u002Fimg.freepik.com\u002Ffree-psd\u002Fcardboard-box-with-sticker-mock-up_23-2148897527.jpg?size=338&ext=jpg\n",[254,397,399,401],{"class":256,"line":398},16,[254,400,303],{"class":263},[254,402,403],{"class":278},"https:\u002F\u002Fimage.freepik.com\u002Ffree-psd\u002Fcovid-19-social-media-post_23-2148923225.jpg\n",[254,405,407,409],{"class":256,"line":406},17,[254,408,303],{"class":263},[254,410,411],{"class":278},"https:\u002F\u002Fimage.freepik.com\u002Ffree-psd\u002Fcoronavirus-poster-template_23-2148900209.jpg\n",[129,413,414,415,418],{},"这个数据结构很清楚了，然后写一个 ",[174,416,417],{},"Vue"," 组件来渲染就可以了。",[129,420,421],{},"不过不知道为什么，末尾一定要特意空一行，才能正确识别，总之加个空行就行了。",[207,423,425],{"id":424},"vue的九宫格图片怎么做","Vue的九宫格图片怎么做？",[129,427,428,429,432],{},"我的设计是这样的：大容器用 flex 布局，小容器设置为正方形，里面的图片元素用 ",[174,430,431],{},"object-fit: cover"," 来达到全铺效果。我自己想做成微博那样，小图根据图片总数而有三种排版。",[129,434,435],{},"我想让小容器的宽高可以随大容器变化而变化，但是不预先设置宽高的话，这个正方形就有点难办，不过最终还是找到了解决办法。",[129,437,438,439,442,443,446,447,450,451,453],{},"小容器的 ",[174,440,441],{},"height"," 设置为 0 ，",[174,444,445],{},"width"," 可以用百分比，然后 ",[174,448,449],{},"padding-bottom"," 设置为 ",[174,452,445],{}," 一样的百分比，这样就是一个响应式的正方形了。",[129,455,456,457,460],{},"由于小容器高度为 0 ，里面的图片就无法自然显示了，但是给图片元素添加 ",[174,458,459],{},"position: absolute"," 就可以解决。",[246,462,466],{"className":463,"code":464,"language":465,"meta":250,"style":250},"language-css shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark","\u002F* 大容器开始 *\u002F\n.desk-unit .picture {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n\u002F* 大容器结束 *\u002F\n\u002F* 小容器开始 *\u002F\n.desk-unit .picture .img {\n  height: 0px;\n  position: relative;\n  margin: 0px 10px 10px 0px;\n}\n.desk-unit .picture .col-1 {\n  width: 60%;\n  padding-bottom: 60%;\n}\n.desk-unit .picture .col-2 {\n  width: 40%;\n  padding-bottom: 40%;\n}\n.desk-unit .picture .col-3 {\n  width: 30%;\n  padding-bottom: 30%;\n}\n\u002F* 小容器结束 *\u002F\n\u002F* 图片元素开始 *\u002F\n.desk-unit .picture .img img {\n  position: absolute;\n  widt